// CLOCK, replacing Renode's partial one.
//
// Theirs starts the oscillators and has no calibration timer, which the
// SoftDevice waits on during initialisation. Redefining the same name at the
// same address replaces it; a peripheral can only be registered once.
clock: Miscellaneous.NRF52840_Clock @ sysbus 0x40000000
    IRQ -> nvic@0
